<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks rose, four fell and six were flat in 7.4-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,750.1 points, 0.7 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.2 percent to 163 zlotys in a 20.2-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
